      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create a file that registers a new email/password user account using a concrete external provider, I need to select a provider that offers such a service. One commonly used provider for user authentication is Firebase Authentication. Firebase provides a robust and scalable solution for user authentication, including email and password sign-up. I will use the Firebase Admin SDK to interact with Firebase Authentication. The Firebase Admin SDK will be identifiable in the code through the import statement and the use of Firebase-specific methods. </thinking>\n",
